  <data key="d2">[Image Name]account_opening_form_unity_bank
[Image Type]Screenshot

The image depicts an account opening form associated with Unity Small Finance Bank Ltd. displayed on a computer screen. The form includes fields for customer details such as 'Customer Branch', 'Customer Name', 'DOB', 'PAN No.', 'Customer No.', 'Mobile No.', and 'Aadhar No.'. There is a dropdown menu labeled 'Document Type' with various options for document submission, including 'Customer Profile Form', 'Voter's Identity Card', 'Aadhar Card', and 'Related Person Photo'. The user interface provides buttons such as 'Search &amp; Download KYC Data', 'Fill CKYC Data', and 'Add Document', with a 'Delete' option available for document management. The bottom of the form includes a 'Save' button to submit information. This interface supports the capture of personal data and documentation needed for the KYC process, aligning with the context provided in the surrounding text.</data>
