This table presents the approved signatures for key personnel in Unity Small Finance Bank, specifically for the year 2025. It comprises three columns: 'Name', 'Designation', and 'Date', indicating the individuals who have authorized processes relevant to retail customer account opening procedures. The table contains a total of four rows, excluding the header row, and defines a clear structure with the first row serving as a merged header that indicates 'Approved by'. The data reveals that Surinderpal Singh R S, in the role of Group Head – Branch Banking Controls, approved actions on June 23, 2025. Ponnuraj P, Head - Product &amp; Distribution, recorded his approval on June 16, 2025, and Gautam Chawla, the National Head - Retail Branch Banking, did so on June 6, 2025. There are no totals, averages, or computed values in the table. It illustrates the hierarchy and responsibility within the organization by showcasing the various titles of approvers, ultimately reflecting the governance structure for retail operations at the bank.</data>
